abstract: >-
  A literature review examining how chronic psychological stress contributes to
  type 2 diabetes mellitus, obesity, and hypertension through sustained
  activation of the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis and sympathetic nervous
  system, cortisol dysregulation, and chronic inflammation. The review also
  considers cortisol as a biomarker, racial and ethnic disparities in stress
  exposure, and stress-related eating behavior. WORKING PAPER: independent
  research, not peer reviewed and not submitted to a journal. Not medical
  advice.
notes: "Working paper. Independent research. Not peer reviewed. Not submitted to a journal. References follow AMA 11th edition."
